parameters.item/Description:
Dear Document Approver,

This is a notification to inform you that a document requires approval.

Please review the document at your earliest convenience to ensure that any necessary updates or actions are completed. 

Document No.: @{outputs('Get_file_properties_-_Document')?['body/Document_x0020_NO']}
Document Title: @{outputs('Get_file_properties_-_Document')?['body/Document_x0020_Title']}
Document Owner: @{outputs('Get_file_properties_-_Document')?['body/Document_x0020_Owner/DisplayName']}
Document Type: @{outputs('Get_file_properties_-_Document')?['body/Tag/Value']}
Revision No.: @{outputs('Get_file_properties_-_Document')?['body/Revision_x0020_No_x002e_']}
Division: @{outputs('Get_file_properties_-_Document')?['body/Division/Value']}
Comments for Approver: @{triggerBody()['text']}

